 "summary": "Gateway profile for the AERCO BMS / BMS II plant sequencer: 188 objects (173 AI, 15 BI), 34 polled by default. It reads header, outside and indoor/return temperatures, header setpoint, fire rate out, boilers fired and on line, the fault/message bits and the configuration menu values. There are no output objects.",
